<br>
<P><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">
<IFRAME FRAMEBORDER=1 ALIGN=CENTER width=100% HEIGHT=200 SCROLLING=YES SRC="http://dynamic.gamespy.com/~peq/ayonaero/ubb/Forum1/HTML/000120.html">
<table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width="90%"><TR><td bgcolor="#D7BB84"><TABLE BORDER=0 cellpadding=4 border=0 cellspacing=1 WIDTH="100%"><TR bgcolor="#D7BB84"><TD COLSPAN=2><CENTER><FONT SIZE="2" COLOR="#54412C" FACE="Verdana, Arial">T O P I C  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; R E V I E W</font></CENTER></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#54412C"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Neener</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">The first Ayonae Ro Rogue Gathering is being held on Saturday, March 24.  The main purpose of this player-run event is for the rogues of ARo to get to know each other, compare notes, and just have fun.  We will be running a PvP tournament during the event; see below for more details.  The rogue gathering and the tournament are open to all rogues of all levels.  <P>Anyone interested in entering the Ayonae Ro Rogue Only PvP Tournament, please go here to sign-up: <A HREF="http://pub13.ezboard.com/fthesafehouseloungegeneraldiscussion.showMessage?topicID=16053.topic" TARGET=_blank>Ayonae Ro Rogue Gathering</A><P>Current events planned for the rogue tourney:<P>FFA matches for the following level ranges:<BR>5-10<BR>11-20<BR>21-30<BR>31-40<BR>41-50<P>One on one elimination matches for lvls 51-60<P>Drunken brawl - open to all lvl 1-60 with the stipulation that all competitors must drink enough booze before the match that they cannot possibly become more drunk<P>The Dark Elf challenge - Richard and Shadowcross have challenged all rogues lvls 1-40 to a single fight, royal rumble style - you against them.<P>Rules of the PvP:<BR>-All poisons are allowed (there will be 56 rezzes available if someone dies to a dot)<BR>-Instill Doubt is not allowed due to a "fix" in the arena that partially disables this skill to prevent death outside the pvp area<BR>-Sneak/Hide will be allowed<BR>-Clickable items and ae procs are allowed<BR>-Outside interference during a match will result in the immediate end of the fight.  Whether the fight is resumed will be at the discretion of the judges.<BR>-All competitors will be debuffed before matches begin.<BR>-Judged matches will be contained to the platform in the arena - competitors who leave the platform during a  match will be warned, and will forfeit the match if they do not return when warned.<P>Organizers are not responsible for revives for "pick-up" fights.  We will make every effort to accomodate those who request a one on one on the platform, but due to time constraints may not be able to allow all matches.  Competitors are welcome to fight amongst themselves off the platform, but revives in these cases will be up to our volunteer clerics who may be busy working on a platform match.  Please respect the clerics as they are all volunteers.  We will have people available to bind you in the Arena.<P>With regards to the concerns about "twinks":<BR>Twinking is a very subjective issue.  While in some cases it is obvious, in others it's a very fine line.  To alleviate the advantage created by non-level appropriate gear, the matches for 50 and under are being done FFA by level groups.  While higher level gear may give an advantage to some, it will also make them a target early in the match, this should help offset that advantage.  The awards for these matches will be level appropriate, regardless of the gear worn by the winner.<P>Some prizes awarded in the tourney are lore items.  If the winner already has the item, I will hold it until you can arrange to have an alt or friend pick it up for you to sell.<P>If you would like more information or would like to volunteer to help with the event, please contact me at dontpanic@kaseyspace.com<P>Nena Bierdieb<BR>Sphere of Transcendence Blackguard<BR>Warden of Ayonae Ro<P>~insert smartass comment here~</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#54412C"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Neener</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Bumping this due to addition of final rules<P>------------------<BR>~insert smartass comment here~</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#54412C"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Kargon</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Sounds fun....almost wish I was a rogue  <IMG SRC="http://dynamic.gamespy.com/~peq/ayonaero/ubb/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Kargon Shadowstalker<BR>Member of guild NIGHTBLADE<BR>"Look at my cat, why can't I live like that?" (&lt;--Lagwagon--&gt;)</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></td></tr></table> 
</IFRAME>
</FONT>
